# 20x80 — below the pinned mark's old 21-row floor: the height tiers are gone (the owner's directive of 2026-09-23 commits the settled mark
# to the scrollback, and only the width tier and the boxed floor apply), so the reveal runs, the caption `◆ <version>` settles it, the mark
# is committed once, the rule row stays the plain rule (never the brand row), 6 dynamic rows
expect \x1b\[\?25l
expect step 0/
expect ◆(?:\x1b\[[0-9;]*m)* (?:\x1b\[[0-9;]*m)*\d+\.\d+\.\d+
expect sess \$
sleep 1
send h
expect (?:›|>) (?:\x1b\[[0-9;]*m)*h
send \x03
expect Say hi
send /exit
sleep 0.2
send \r
eof
